player_prompt.intro:
O wena Player {player_id} mo kgweleng ya Iterated Prisoner's Dilemma ya batlhophi ba 3. Kgwele e tshwarelela {num_rounds} di round.
Mokgwelo wa round:
• {conv_rounds} di turn tsa go bua ka mahala
• 1 turn ya ditshwetso - romela token e le nngwe kwa mmaba o mongwe le o mongwe: '[<opp-id> cooperate]' goba '[<opp-id> defect]' (e.g. '[1 defect] [2 cooperate]'; default ke 'cooperate'). 
Matrix ya pair-wise payoff (e dirisiwa kwa mongwe wa dipalo tse di sa rangweng):
  - Ba bedi ba cooperate  ->  {reward}
  - Ba bedi ba defect     ->  {punishment}
  - Wena o defect, bone ba cooperate -> {temptation}
  - Wena o cooperate, bone ba defect -> {sucker}
Mothophi yo o na le tse di kwa godimo mo kgweleng e feleletseng o a fenya.
